    <briefdescription>
<para>Thread-safe diagnostic event emitter. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Centralizes emission of diagnostic messages for state transitions, patch operations, and rollout changes. Listeners receive events in structured form (<ref refid="structthemis_1_1updates_1_1_error_context" kindref="compound">ErrorContext</ref>) suitable for machine parsing, logging, and automation.</para>
<para>Example usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1updates_1_1_diagnostic_emitter_1aabdd4c9bda3c29a5ee44ef1e5e656a55" kindref="member">DiagnosticEmitter</ref><sp/>emitter;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">emitter.addListener(std::make_shared&lt;JsonFileListener&gt;(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;updates.jsonl&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">));</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ErrorContext<sp/>ctx;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ctx.operation<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;apply_patch&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ctx.phase<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;applying&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ctx.error_code<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1updates_1a7438c190509f090b57c64b4140cbe465a3431eeb7a9a6c5d8388455441e306cd5" kindref="member">DiagnosticErrorCode::PATCH_CHECKSUM_MISMATCH</ref>;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ctx.severity<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1updates_1a76a19f06c0d0177d4ee1be662fbcb57dabb1ca97ec761fc37101737ba0aa2e7c5" kindref="member">DiagnosticSeverity::ERROR</ref>;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ctx.message<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Checksum<sp/>mismatch<sp/>for<sp/>bin/themis_server&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">emitter.emitError(ctx);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
